### Output Validation

Validate procedure output to ensure consistency:

```typescript
export const apiRouter = router({
  // Output validation with Zod
  getUser: publicProcedure
    .input(z.string())
    .output(z.object({
      id: z.string(),
      email: z.string().email(),
      name: z.string(),
      createdAt: z.date(),
    }))
    .query(async ({ input }) => {
      const user = await db.user.findUnique({
        where: { id: input },
