## 🛡️ Middleware (Authorization & Logging)

### Authentication Middleware

Simple token-based auth (not JWT):

```typescript
export const protectedProcedure = publicProcedure.use(({ ctx, next }) => {
  if (!ctx.user) {
    throw new TRPCError({
      code: 'UNAUTHORIZED',
      message: 'You must provide a valid token',
    });
  }
  return next({ ctx: { user: ctx.user } });
});
```

### Logging Middleware

Track request timing:

```typescript
export const loggedProcedure = publicProcedure.use(async ({ path, type, next }) => {
  const start = Date.now();
  console.log(`📥 ${type} ${path}`);
  const result = await next();
  console.log(`✅ ${type} ${path} - ${Date.now() - start}ms`);
  return result;
});
```

